  "reward_bound_derivation": "All five float32 components are returned and exposed. Each actor has one action. At most three own-crew deliveries contribute 4.2 to a member and at most nine foreign deliveries to that crew contribute 9.0; personal reward is at most 0.6. Only two initially unbuilt pylons can produce first-installation events, at most 0.5 shared reward. Thus 14.3 is a loose positive per-actor bound. One action spends at most three material units plus one effort, and at most four anchors wear, so the lower bound is no smaller than -0.57. Declared [-2,20] is conservative. Village cumulative receipt cannot exceed 12*512=6144. Counts, energy, tools, progress and all observed reward components fit [-2,6144].",
